---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /
title: "Yentrans Maritime Logistics | Freight Forwarding, Customs & Transport"
seoDescription: "Yentrans Maritime Logistics coordinates ocean freight, customs documentation, inland transportation and specialised cargo movements from India and the Middle East."
---
<section class="hero">
  <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="{{ '/assets/video/hero-port-poster.jpg' | url }}"
         aria-hidden="true"><source src="{{ '/assets/video/hero-port.mp4' | url }}" type="video/mp4"></video>
  <div class="wrap hero-in">
    {# "Registered NVOCC" is gated (WEB-08 PENDING) and the founding year is gated
       (YML-001 PENDING). Both reappear automatically once approved. #}
    <p class="eyebrow">Kochi{% if approvals.corporate.established2009.value %} &nbsp;·&nbsp; Established 2009{% endif %} &nbsp;·&nbsp; India, UAE &amp; Oman</p>
    <h1>Freight is a people business with steel around it.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Yentrans Maritime Logistics coordinates ocean freight, customs documentation,
      inland transportation and specialised cargo movements. From Indian ports to the Middle East
      and international destinations, our teams focus on the details that keep cargo moving.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ '/request-a-quote/' | url }}">Request a Rate <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn-onDark" href="{{ '/services/' | url }}">Explore Our Services</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% include "partials/quote-widget.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Who we are</p>
      <h2>Freight doesn't move on a promise alone.</h2>
      <p class="lede">It moves when equipment is available, paperwork is right, the routing makes sense,
        and the right people stay accountable. Yentrans has built its business around the practical
        work behind every shipment — connecting cargo, carriers and customers across markets.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-3">
      {%- for s in services.items %}{% if s.featured %}
      <article class="cell reveal">
        <h3><a href="{{ ('/services/' + s.slug + '/') | url }}">{{ s.title }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ s.summary | truncate(185) }}</p>
      </article>
      {% endif %}{%- endfor %}
      <article class="cell reveal">
        <h3><a href="{{ '/industries/' | url }}">Industry Solutions</a></h3>
        <p>Logistics designed around the realities of different products and supply chains.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec-ink">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Operational principles</p>
      <h2>The useful detail is usually in the next question.</h2>
      <p class="lede">What happens if the first sailing fills? Who checks the temperature instruction?
        Which document needs to agree with the invoice? When does inland transport need to be ready?
        We ask these questions early, because the smallest overlooked detail can become the largest delay.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-4">
      <article class="cell reveal"><span class="num">01</span><h3>Experienced Coordination</h3>
        <p>The people managing the shipment understand its documentation, handling and timing requirements.</p></article>
      <article class="cell reveal"><span class="num">02</span><h3>Options, Not Just Rates</h3>
        <p>Routing decisions consider realistic space, transit considerations and operational dependencies.</p></article>
      <article class="cell reveal"><span class="num">03</span><h3>Reefer Discipline</h3>
        <p>Temperature-sensitive cargo has taught us the value of checking instructions, equipment and handovers carefully.</p></article>
      <article class="cell reveal"><span class="num">04</span><h3>Regional Execution</h3>
        <p>Teams in India and the Middle East connect local cargo operations with international shipping networks.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Industries</p>
      <h2>Every cargo has its own operating logic.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Fresh produce, healthcare goods, automotive components, construction materials and
        industrial equipment do not move under the same constraints. Explore how we approach the cargo
        requirements of different industries.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      {%- for slug in ["seafood-fisheries","agriculture-fresh-produce","pharma-healthcare","automotive-components","project-cargo","retail-consumer-goods"] %}
      {%- for i in industries.items %}{% if i.slug == slug %}
      <article class="cell reveal">
        <h3>{% if i.flagship %}<a href="{{ ('/industries/' + i.slug + '/') | url }}">{{ i.title }}</a>{% else %}<a href="{{ '/industries/#' + i.slug | url }}">{{ i.title }}</a>{% endif %}</h3>
        <p>{{ i.summary | truncate(170) }}</p>
      </article>
      {% endif %}{%- endfor %}{%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="sec-more"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ '/industries/' | url }}">View All Industries</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec-wash">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Network</p>
      <h2>Strong at origin. Connected at destination.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Kochi is where our story began. Today, Yentrans supports cargo movements through its
        network in India and operations in Dubai and Oman, working with international carriers and
        destination partners when a movement reaches beyond our own offices.</p>
    </div>
    {# Rendered from the approved branch directory, so the page can never claim
       a location the data has not cleared. An unapproved one shows as presence
       without an address rather than being silently dropped. #}
    <div class="net-regions">
      {%- for g in offices.groups %}
      <div class="net-region reveal">
        <p class="net-region-h">{{ g.title }}</p>
        <ul>
          {%- for id in g.ids %}{% for o in offices.locations %}{% if o.id == id %}
          <li>
            {%- if o.approved %}<strong>{{ o.city }}</strong>{% if o.isHeadOffice %} — head office{% elif o.role %} — {{ o.role | lower }}{% endif %}
            {%- else %}<span class="is-pending">{{ o.city }} — pending confirmation</span>{% endif %}
          </li>
          {%- endif %}{% endfor %}{%- endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="sec-more"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ '/network/' | url }}">See Our Network</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

{% set latest = collections.articlesPublished | limit(3) %}
{% if latest.length %}
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Latest Insights</p>
      <h2>Notes from the freight desk.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Practical explanations of shipping terms, cargo planning and the developments
        shaping international trade. Articles are reviewed before publication.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      {%- for a in latest %}
      <article class="cell reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">{{ a.data.category }}</p>
        <h3><a href="{{ a.url | url }}">{{ a.data.title }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ a.data.excerpt }}</p>
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="sec-more"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ '/insights/' | url }}">Explore Insights</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% set ctaHeading = "Tell us the lane. We'll discuss the options." %}
{% set ctaBody = "Share your origin, destination, cargo and approximate shipment date. We'll help identify the information and routing options needed to move forward." %}
{% set ctaAction = "Request a Freight Quote" %}
<section class="split-cta">
  <div class="a reveal">
    <h2>Help make trade move.</h2>
    <p>Explore opportunities in freight operations, customer service, documentation,
      transportation, sales and corporate functions.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-onDark" href="{{ '/careers/' | url }}">Explore Careers <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="b reveal">
    <h2>Freight, explained.</h2>
    <p>Practical guides to containers, documentation, Incoterms and reefer planning,
      written for importers and exporters rather than for other forwarders.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-onDark" href="{{ '/resources/' | url }}">Knowledge Hub <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}

<script type="application/ld+json">{{ {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": ["Organization","LocalBusiness"],
  "name": site.name, "alternateName": "YML",
  "url": site.productionUrl,
  "description": site.defaultDescription,
  "address": { "@type": "PostalAddress",
    "streetAddress": "Old Rubber Board Building, Indira Gandhi Road, Willingdon Island",
    "addressLocality": "Kochi", "addressRegion": "Kerala",
    "postalCode": "682003", "addressCountry": "IN" },
  "telephone": site.enquiryPhone, "email": site.enquiryEmail,
  "areaServed": { "@type": "Place", "name": "Worldwide" }
} | jsonld | safe }}</script>
